Please read this agreement before installing or using the DigitalOwnership
LibreOffice extension. By installing or using the extension, you agree to these
terms.

1. Purpose

The extension helps users calculate a digital fingerprint of a supported office
document and start a blockchain registration or verification workflow with the
DigitalOwnership service.

The extension does not create copyright, transfer copyright, decide authorship,
or replace legal advice. A blockchain registration is a technical timestamp and
audit trail for a document fingerprint.

